30,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems some rooms are naturally colder than others, and a fixed system can truly free the mind from worry.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Midori,,I've seen that payments are often late and people are avoiding the cooler to avoid conflict. It's quite sad.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minato,,The power use is actually very different between rooms! Some use four times more than others.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"The bills swing wildly between summer and winter, and fitting meters would be quite an expensive upfront cost.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Managing the bills manually... it takes a lot of time. Even with a template, it's a lot of data entry.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, if the usage varies that much, it explains why some might feel the current split is unfair.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, if the costs fluctuate so much, no wonder people get stressed when the bill arrives.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, I think that's why people are arguing. It's not just the amount, but who is using what.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, so any system that requires a lot of monthly calculating is just going to be a burden.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,Yes... I don't want anyone to spend their whole evening doing math.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must avoid a situation where we are afraid to turn on the heat in our own home.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Midori,,I just want us to stop feeling like a reminder is an accusation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minato,,"If we can see exactly what we use, maybe the rumors about ""carrying"" others will stop.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,But we can't spend a fortune on electricians just to solve a monthly argument.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with May. A complex system sounds like a lot of work for the person in charge.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
