55,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B, the Seasonal Fixed Rate, sounds like a way to bring warmth and peace back to our winters.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option C is the simplest, but Option B might stop the monthly tension over fluctuating amounts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A would be the most honest since the usage is so different, but it sounds expensive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A is too pricey to install. Option C is easy, but Option B handles those huge winter spikes better.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option C is the least amount of work. Option A and B seem like they would take more time to manage.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, a fixed rate only needs settling once a year. It is much simpler than monthly disputes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, do you think the ""honesty"" of meters is worth the cost and the installation stress?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
